### List catalog without authentication (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/catalog?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

# Response body:
# {"statusCode":401,"title":"Authentication required","message":"Authentication required.","timestamp":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","path":"/orders/catalog?page=1&pageSize=20"}

### List catalog with an unauthorized profile (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/catalog?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer replace-with-viewer-token
Accept: application/json

# Response body:
# {"statusCode":403,"title":"Access denied","message":"Access denied.","timestamp":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","path":"/orders/catalog?page=1&pageSize=20"}

### Preview an order and issue a preview token (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "kind": "portion",
      "quantity": 1,
      "sizeId": "{{sizeId}}",
      "accompanimentIds": []
    }
  ]
}

# Response body:
# {
#   "cart": {"lines": [], "subtotal": 10, "totalDiscount": 0, "total": 10},
#   "previewToken": "{{previewToken}}"
# }

### Preview with malformed body (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"lines": []}

