### Replay an order (200 registered replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "{{idempotencyKey}}",
  "previewToken": "{{previewToken}}",
  "lines": [{
    "productId": "{{productId}}",
    "kind": "portion",
    "quantity": 1,
    "sizeId": "{{sizeId}}",
    "accompanimentIds": []
  }]
}

# Response body:
# {"kind":"registered","replayed":true,"order":{"id":"00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010","sequenceNumber":1,"lines":[],"discounts":[],"subtotal":10,"totalDiscount":0,"total":10}}

### Reprice before confirmation (200 repriced)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
  "previewToken": "{{previewToken}}",
  "lines": [{
    "productId": "{{productId}}",
    "kind": "portion",
    "quantity": 1,
    "sizeId": "{{sizeId}}",
    "accompanimentIds": []
  }]
}

# Response body:
# {"kind":"repriced","recalculatedCart":{"lines":[],"subtotal":12,"totalDiscount":0,"total":12},"previewToken":"{{previewToken}}","changes":[{"kind":"channel","previous":{"label":"Sem canal","amount":10},"current":{"label":"Delivery","amount":12}}]}

### Registration requiring stock review (409 review-required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "previewToken": "{{previewToken}}",
  "lines": [{
    "productId": "{{productId}}",
    "kind": "portion",
    "quantity": 999,
    "sizeId": "{{sizeId}}",
    "accompanimentIds": []
  }]
}

# Response body:
# {"kind":"review-required","shortages":[{"productId":"{{productId}}","productName":"Chocolate","unit":"un","requiredQuantity":999,"availableQuantity":0}],"changes":[]}

### Registration requiring correction (409 correction-required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
  "previewToken": "{{previewToken}}",
  "lines": [{
    "productId": "{{productId}}",
    "kind": "portion",
    "quantity": 1,
    "sizeId": "{{invalidSizeId}}",
    "accompanimentIds": []
  }]
}

# Response body:
# {"kind":"correction-required","invalidConfigurations":[{"productId":"{{productId}}","productName":"Chocolate","selectedKind":"portion","selectedId":"{{invalidSizeId}}","reason":"size","correctiveMessage":"O tamanho selecionado não está mais disponível."}],"shortages":[],"changes":[]}

### Conflicting idempotency key (409 standard error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idempotencyKey": "{{idempotencyKey}}",
  "previewToken": "{{previewToken}}",
  "lines": [{"productId":"{{productId}}","kind":"portion","quantity":2,"sizeId":"{{sizeId}}","accompanimentIds":[]}]
}

# Response body:
# {"statusCode":409,"title":"Erro de Conflito","message":"A chave de idempotência já foi usada em outro pedido.","timestamp":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","path":"/orders"}

